'''Livingstone Croft''' is a farm located in the [[Arathi Highlands]], to the west of [[Stromgarde Keep]]. It is the home of the [[Livingstone]] family, which is looking for adventurers to keep the farm safe and operational.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

